author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: "The docs-skills gate derives the family set from PM_COMMAND_CAPABILITY_CONTRACTS and fails when any family has no non-generated guide topic, with a proven negative control; The docs-skills gate validates every --flag in a fenced skill invocation against the core contract, the global flags, and package-declared flags, with a proven negative control; evidence and automation guide topics exist with workflows and docs and the merge topic names reconcile and report; No agent-facing skill or README carries a hand-maintained literal guide topic list and every corrected instruction was executed against the built CLI"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: medium
environment: "pm-cli 2026.9.4 build, .agents/skills and plugins/*/skills at 751aa44c0"
repro_steps: "Run pm package manage --detail summary, pm comments <id> --add x --allow-audit-comment on a bare install, grep learnings across .agents/skills and plugins, and compare guide topic commands against PM_COMMAND_CAPABILITY_CONTRACTS families"
resolution: "Added evidence and automation guide topics plus a merge reconcile workflow, two artifact-derived docs-skills gate checks (capability-family routing and fenced flag spelling) with negative controls, 25 skill corrections including the package prerequisite for review flags and the doctor spelling, the missing merge flag contract rows with a 24 to 27 budget re-ratchet, regenerated contracts and lexicon docs, and the recurrence family triggers."
expected_result: Every fenced instruction in a skill executes on the build that ships it and every declared capability family is routed by a workflow topic
actual_result: "All 12 skills and 16 references pass the fenced-flag and deprecated-spelling checks, 9 of 9 capability families route through a non-generated topic, and guide learnings, record, and calendar resolve to the new topics"
affected_version: 2026.9.4
component: "docs-skills-gate, sdk/guide-topics, .agents/skills, plugins skills"
