comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T18:26:04.989Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check: searched skills coverage, guide topic routing, nonexistent flags in skills, learnings routing. The closed 2026-08-16 skills-routing owner (linked recurs_from) satisfied the family census by hand at the time. No open owner. Every instruction listed in the description was executed against the built 2026.9.4 CLI before filing."
  "2026-09-04T19:08:45.832Z","harness:claude-code","Shipped. Every instruction listed in the description was executed against the built 2026.9.4 CLI before and after the change. Gate: validateCapabilityFamilyRouting derives families from the built capability contract and refuses any family without a hand-written topic (negative control: an automation family routed only by the generated listing fails; vacuous guard: an empty family set fails). validateFencedFlagSpellings checks every fenced --flag under .agents/skills and plugins against the command contract, the global flags, and package-declared flags (negative control: --bogus and a doctor flag on comments fail; vacuous guard: an empty flag table fails). Guide: evidence (aliases record, annotations, learnings, history-maintenance) and automation (calendar, reminders, meetings, events) topics added; 15 topics render through guide-shell in a sandbox, evidence brief is 3.7 KB. Skills: 19 files corrected, nine literal topic lists replaced by the runtime index pointer, package prerequisite named for the review flags, doctor and package spellings fixed, learnings routed in the developer loop, user capability map, playbook, and backlog shaping. Contract: MERGE_FLAG_CONTRACTS declares --message, --force, --include-reconciled with the merge budget raised 24 to 27; contracts snapshot and FLAG_LEXICON_BUDGETS regenerated. Policy: declared-set family v2 triggers on the gate, the guide, and both skill trees.\n"
  "2026-09-04T19:08:46.354Z","harness:claude-code","Verification: node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage 603 files, 8373 tests, exact 100/100/100/100; pnpm quality:static passed including the tracker-context-quality, graph-composition, and record-integrity assurance dry-runs; pnpm lint:eslint and lint:duplicates clean; pnpm security:scan clean; docs-skills gate passed with the two new checks live; contracts snapshot and FLAG_LEXICON_BUDGETS regenerated; 15 guide topics render through guide-shell in a sandbox."
